      <data key="k_type">PERSON</data>
      <data key="k_desc">"Aisling is a participant in the discussion who discusses memorable NPCs in "Cyberpunk 2077," especially Judy, and the influence of player choices on character development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, agreeing with ThaneChambers about the gang's ideals crumbling and the toxic nature of alliances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, discussing the emotional experience and storytelling in 'Firewatch' and 'The Beginner's Guide'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, expressing deep emotional resonance with the game's ending and the music's impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, focusing on Dutch van der Linde's transformation and his complex relationships with the gang members."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, imagining elemental ability combos that create synergistic gameplay effects."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling loves discussions that open up new insights into games and looks forward to analyzing future releases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, sharing her experience with traps and engaging in conversations about game mechanics and recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant who praises 'Ghost of Tsushima' for its soundtrack that enhances the samurai journey experience and immersion into the game's world."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, describing the forest areas as mysterious and emotionally impactful due to their visuals and sound design."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, expressing admiration for 'Ghost of Tsushima' for its combat mechanics and stunning visuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, mentioning 'Final Fantasy VII Remake' and 'Returnal' for their visuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, mentioning 'Undertale' as an example of a game that starts simple but delves into heavy themes about choices and morality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, sharing her experience with the battle against Ornstein and Smough in 'Dark Souls'."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant in the discussion, suggesting diverse settings like historical locations and emphasizing cultural contexts for missions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aisling is a participant who agrees with ThaneChambers and highlights the character development in "Modern Warfare"."</data>
      <data key="k_deg">7</data>
